sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as ROS 2 Client
    participant N as adi_iio node
    participant H as libiio ctx / IIO HW
    C->>N: EventAttrWriteString(iio_path, value)
    N->>H: write event attribute (device / channel)
    H-->>N: bytes written / errno
    N-->>C: success=true + message="" (no read-back on success)
    Note over N,C: on failure, success=false and message carries the errno string
